{
  "name": "Send weekly shift reminders to security agents with Gmail and Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -580,
        -149
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 420,
        "height": 1460,
        "content": "## Send Weekly Shift Reminders to Security Agents\n\nEvery Monday morning, this workflow reads your Google Sheets shift schedule, identifies confirmed shifts that have not been notified yet, sends each agent a personalized email with their upcoming shift details, and marks the row as notified — fully hands-free.\n\n### How it works\n\n1. **Every Monday 07:00** fires the workflow on a weekly schedule.\n2. **Configure** holds all user-facing settings (sheet URL).\n3. **Read Schedule Sheet** fetches all rows from your shift schedule.\n4. **Capture Row Index** assigns each row a unique index for the final update.\n5. **Filter Confirmed & Unnotified** keeps only rows with Status = Confirmed and no prior notification date.\n6. **Send Shift Email** delivers a personalized shift reminder to each agent via Gmail.\n7. **Prepare Row Update** retrieves the row index for the sheet update.\n8. **Update Notification Status** marks the row as Notified and records today's date.\n\n### Setup\n\n1. Connect your **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential.\n2. Connect your **Gmail OAuth2** credential.\n3. In the **Configure** node, replace `sheetUrl` with your Google Sheets URL.\n4. Ensure your sheet has these columns: Agent_Name, Email, Shift_Date, Shift_Start, Shift_End, Site, Status, Notified.\n5. Set Status to **Confirmed** for shifts ready to notify.\n6. Activate the workflow.\n\n### Customization\n\n- Change the trigger day and time in the **Every Monday 07:00** node.\n- Edit the email subject or body in the **Send Shift Email** node.\n- Add a Chef_Contact column and include it in the email body."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "Trigger & Configure",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -60,
        -149
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 1,
        "width": 720,
        "height": 369,
        "content": "## Trigger & Configure\n\nFires every Monday at 07:00. The Configure node holds all user-facing settings — update `sheetUrl` before activating."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "Read Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        740,
        -147
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 1,
        "width": 720,
        "height": 367,
        "content": "## Read Data\n\nFetches all rows from the shift schedule sheet. Assigns each row a unique index for the final status update."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "Filter & Send",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1540,
        -147
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 1,
        "width": 720,
        "height": 367,
        "content": "## Filter & Send\n\nKeeps only confirmed shifts not yet notified. Sends a personalized HTML shift reminder to each agent via Gmail."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "Notify & Update",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2340,
        -147
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 1,
        "width": 720,
        "height": 367,
        "content": "## Notify & Update\n\nRetrieves the row index after email send. Updates Google Sheets: Status to Notified, records today's date."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "Every Monday 07:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 7 * * 1"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.3
    },
    {
      "name": "Configure",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        400,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "cfg-sheet-url",
              "name": "sheetUrl",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/YOUR_SHEET_ID_HERE/edit"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": false
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "name": "Read Schedule Sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "position": [
        800,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "resource": "sheet",
        "operation": "read",
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": 0
        },
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "={{ $('Configure').first().json.sheetUrl }}"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.7
    },
    {
      "name": "Capture Row Index",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        1200,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "assign-row",
              "name": "row_number",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ $itemIndex + 2 }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "name": "Filter Confirmed & Unnotified",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "position": [
        1600,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 3,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-status",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.Status }}",
              "rightValue": "Confirmed"
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-notified",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "empty",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.Notified }}",
              "rightValue": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.3
    },
    {
      "name": "Send Shift Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "position": [
        2000,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.Email }}",
        "message": "={{ \"<html><body style=\\\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\\\"><p>Hello <strong>\" + $json.Agent_Name + \"</strong>,</p><p>This is a reminder of your upcoming shift:</p><table border=\\\"1\\\" cellpadding=\\\"8\\\"><tr><td>Date</td><td>\" + $json.Shift_Date + \"</td></tr><tr><td>Start</td><td>\" + $json.Shift_Start + \"</td></tr><tr><td>End</td><td>\" + $json.Shift_End + \"</td></tr><tr><td>Site</td><td>\" + $json.Site + \"</td></tr></table><p>Please contact your supervisor if you have any questions.</p><p>Best regards</p></body></html>\" }}",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        },
        "subject": "={{ \"Shift reminder — \" + $json.Shift_Date }}",
        "resource": "message",
        "emailType": "html",
        "operation": "send"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "name": "Prepare Row Update",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        2400,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "restore-row",
              "name": "row_number",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ $('Filter Confirmed & Unnotified').item.json.row_number }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "name": "Update Notification Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "position": [
        2800,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "columns": {
          "value": {
            "Status": "Notified",
            "Notified": "={{ $now.toFormat('dd/MM/yyyy') }}",
            "row_number": "={{ $json.row_number }}"
          },
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "matchingColumns": [
            "row_number"
          ]
        },
        "options": {},
        "resource": "sheet",
        "operation": "update",
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": 0
        },
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "={{ $('Configure').first().json.sheetUrl }}"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.7
    }
  ],
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "connections": {
